    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010340/extras/61fee28eff0cab4d669603b3537cb4fb.avif?t=1688132068\" /></div><br>Indie fighting game<br><strong>The game contains 3 game methods</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1- Chapters</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010340/extras/102c922f75a70c11caffcfad7c21a66e.avif?t=1688132068\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2- Local multiplayer (3D)</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010340/extras/d61285ae624da8057bad9f28aa70b751.avif?t=1688132068\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3- Online ( 3D )</h2>In the Online mode, you are going to face a real person and fight them to get more and more ranks to open your mission and get EXP to build your own character and make him stronger, <br><strong>there are 5 Ranks in the game for each rank you are going to get EXP to build your ability,</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010340/extras/0881fd8e8f2245dc0939475e15b9f09f.avif?t=1688132068\" /></div><br><u>for each win, you are going to get 2 points<br>if you lost the game, you are going to lose 2 points</u><br>if you faced any problems, please send an email to <a href=\"mailto:(skullsameh.work@gmail.com)\">(skullsameh.work@gmail.com)</a><br>enjoy",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010340/extras/61fee28eff0cab4d669603b3537cb4fb.avif?t=1688132068\" /></div><br>Indie fighting game<br><strong>The game contains 3 game methods</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1- Chapters</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010340/extras/102c922f75a70c11caffcfad7c21a66e.avif?t=1688132068\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2- Local multiplayer (3D)</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010340/extras/d61285ae624da8057bad9f28aa70b751.avif?t=1688132068\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3- Online ( 3D )</h2>In the Online mode, you are going to face a real person and fight them to get more and more ranks to open your mission and get EXP to build your own character and make him stronger, <br><strong>there are 5 Ranks in the game for each rank you are going to get EXP to build your ability,</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010340/extras/0881fd8e8f2245dc0939475e15b9f09f.avif?t=1688132068\" /></div><br><u>for each win, you are going to get 2 points<br>if you lost the game, you are going to lose 2 points</u><br>if you faced any problems, please send an email to <a href=\"mailto:(skullsameh.work@gmail.com)\">(skullsameh.work@gmail.com)</a><br>enjoy",
